+    # inference requests. A dead stream / wrong host:port — or even a single dead
+    # sensor — otherwise yields a snapshot the hot path silently zero-fills,
+    # running the eval on (partly) blank tactile. We wait (not busy-spin) until
+    # ALL fingers have produced at least one frame; a genuine no-contact frame
