+            f"--high-freq-tactile: {len(_missing)}/{len(finger_specs)} finger(s) "
+            f"produced no tactile on tcp://{config.tactile_host}:{config.tactile_port} "
+            f"within {TACTILE_WAIT_TIMEOUT_S}s: {_missing}. Check the Thor "
+            f"sharpa_dds_bridge is publishing ALL sensors and "
+            f"--tactile-host/--tactile-port are correct."
