+        # Extract joint angles for FK. ASSUMPTION (cannot be checked here): the
+        # state_data["left_hand"] / ["right_hand"] vectors are already in the
+        # exact URDF joint order that SharpaWaveFK consumes. The dataset stores
+        # these as a bare slice with no joint names, so only the DIMENSION is
+        # validated downstream (SharpaWaveFK.forward) -- a wrong ORDER passes
+        # silently and corrupts the spatial anchors. SharpaWaveFK logs its
+        # expected joint order at construction; verify your dataset matches it
+        # (see SharpaWaveFK.get_expected_joint_names()). (PR review: matthewmzy.)
